 * }
 *
 * Also requires customParams.artefactRepository: { owner, repo }
 * (falls back to aiRepository or targetRepository)
 *
 * Result in GitHub:
 *   Release:  [AI] [PROJ-123] Artefacts   (tag: ai-proj-123)
 *   Assets:   copilot-session.zip, agent-outputs.zip
